{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1b23d7c6-c4cf-8800-95ed-177a2a6e8153",
  "created_at": "2026-03-04T13:23:51-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Maureen Quinn",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:19:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:19:56-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, this is Maureen Quinn. I want to put up a fence, and I need to know if that requires a permit or if I just call the city and tell you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:20:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Generally a fence does need a permit, yeah. It's not usually just a phone call. What kind of fence are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:20:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cedar. Four feet tall. It would go around the side yard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:20:19-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-foot cedar, side yard. Is it a regular wood fence, like pickets or boards?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:20:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Pickets, I think. Is that different from boards? I'm not sure what the difference would be for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:20:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not a big difference for the permit question. We just want to know the material and the height so we can note it on the application. Is this the front, side, or back of the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:20:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The side. I want to close it in for my grandson. He's two, and he goes right for the driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:20:50-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Side yards can have their own rules, depending on how close it is to the street and the property line. So you'd want to go through the application and let us look at where it sits."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:21:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I call, and then I get a permit over the phone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:21:08-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, not over the phone. You fill out an application, usually with a simple sketch of your lot showing where the fence goes. You can pick one up here at City Hall, or get it on the city website."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:21:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A sketch. Like a drawing? I'm not an artist."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:21:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Nothing fancy. A rough outline of the lot, the house, and a line where the fence goes. Measurements help. If you have a survey of the property, that's even better."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:21:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I might have a survey somewhere. Hold on one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:21:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, Denise, put it on my desk, I'll look at it after lunch. Yes. Thank you. Sorry, I'm back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:21:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:21:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Now, do I have to tell the neighbor? The house next door is close to where the fence would go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:21:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's not something I'd tell you is a notice requirement in the way you're thinking, but it's a good idea to let them know. And the fence has to be on your own property, so that's where the survey comes in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:22:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I don't have to send them a letter or anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:22:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I wouldn't say it's a letter thing. If it turns out the application needs anything like that, the inspector will tell you when you submit. But talking to your neighbor first usually saves headaches."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:22:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm. I thought you would notify them. Isn't that how it works with the zoning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:22:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's for some other kinds of projects, like variances. A standard fence permit is different. If your fence needs special approval for some reason, then that changes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:22:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And how would I know if it needs special approval?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:22:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "When you bring in the application, we'll look at it. If the fence is four feet and set back on your own land, it's most likely straightforward. But the inspector makes the call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:22:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So, permit, a sketch, and talk to the neighbor. And it's not a phone call to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:23:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Permit, sketch, and the survey if you can find it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:23:07-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Where do I get the application? You said City Hall or the website?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:23:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both. Come to the counter here, we're open during business hours, or look under the zoning and inspections page on the city site."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:23:20-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm not very good with the website. I'll come by. Do I need to bring anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:23:26-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Your sketch, the survey if you have it, and a description of the fence. You've already told me most of it. Cedar, four feet, picket style."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:23:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Cedar, four feet. I think I have it. I'm still a little unsure about the neighbor part, but I'll ask the inspector."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:23:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. Ask when you come in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:23:46-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Lombardi. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-04T13:23:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
